{"seq":10,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:09:28.140Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"36552ad9ca929a2548a2ebe7bac41c1161eb03027c79ccc98e1e1d5b23ff4d53","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests show.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It used to be Nadia Fennimore's account. The 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says the CRM reassignment took effect on **2026-05-04**.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he took it over that day too. The earlier digests already call it \"Gideon's fleet account\", so I can't confirm who held it before that.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 12/1/25 and 9/30/26 digests both call it \"Gideon's medical account\". A 3/2025 digest called it Nadia's medical account, so it moved at some point. No digest records the handover date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner. They only say \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". Nadia did volunteer to run QFO's gate-clerk training in the 9/30 digest, but that doesn't prove she owns the account. Please confirm this one in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nI found no digest dated after 9/30, so the Vantorre Group, Vantorre Mobility and Orlavine owners are as of that digest."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
